 {"id":"4.33","q":"In the 1973 oil crisis, OPEC:","o":["Quadrupled prices to almost $12 a barrel and stopped exports to the US, Japan and western Europe","Cut prices to $12 a barrel","Allowed negative prices","Merged with Russia to form OPEC+"],"a":0,"w":"That is the book's account of the first oil crisis."},
